1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,500
Dinner for two

2
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:07,300
Wash the tomatoes.

3
00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:10,700
Slice them nice and thin.

4
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:13,700
Chop the garlic very fine.

5
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:16,500
And the onion too.

6
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:19,700
A little ginger. It's optional.

7
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:23,300
A good glug of olive oil.

8
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:26,800
Squeeze in half a lemon.

9
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:28,800
A little honey.

10
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:31,400
Some coarse salt.

11
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:34,200
Black pepper.

12
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:37,400
Mash it until it emulsifies.

13
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:40,600
Lay the tomatoes on a plate.

14
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:44,000
Spoon the dressing over.

15
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:46,800
Peel the skin off the sausage.

16
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:49,800
Chop the sausage.

17
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:53,600
A little oil and a spoon of the dressing.

18
00:00:54,400 --> 00:00:56,300
Brown it well.

19
00:00:57,100 --> 00:00:59,800
A splash of white wine.

20
00:01:00,600 --> 00:01:02,200
Let it reduce.

21
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:05,400
Lay the sausage over the tomatoes.

22
00:01:06,200 --> 00:01:08,000
And the juices on top.

23
00:01:08,800 --> 00:01:11,800
And it's ready to eat.
